# TikTok Channel Intelligence API

### 根路径
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### 登录成功
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录失败
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 当前用户
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer fake-token-for-admin

### 创建 TikTok 渠道数据源
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/sources
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shop": "ETCYY-US",
  "account": "wardrobepicked",
  "source_url": "https://www.tiktok.com/@wardrobepicked",
  "is_active": true
}

### 查询数据源列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/sources

### 触发指定数据源采集
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/sources/1/collect

### 查询采集记录
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/collection-runs

### 查询看板总览
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/summary

### 查询完整看板数据
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/dashboard

### 查询筛选项
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/filters

### 查询视频列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/videos?page=1&page_size=20

### 按店铺筛选视频
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/videos?shop=ETCYY-US&page=1&page_size=20

### 查询内容信号
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/channel-intelligence/signals
